			<h1>How to Disable AI Overview on Google</h1>
			<p class="intro">Four methods to remove AI-generated summaries from your search results.</p>

			<nav class="toc">
				<h2>Contents</h2>
				<ol>
					<li><a href="#why">Why Disable AI Overview?</a></li>
					<li><a href="#method-1">Method 1: Use Unslop Search (Easiest)</a></li>
					<li><a href="#method-2">Method 2: Add udm=14 to URL</a></li>
					<li><a href="#method-3">Method 3: Add -ai to Your Query</a></li>
					<li><a href="#method-4">Method 4: Browser Extension</a></li>
					<li><a href="#chrome">Disable AI in Chrome</a></li>
					<li><a href="#set-as-default">Set as Default Search Engine</a></li>
